<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in tonnes 66 Brix for Oct 7-13 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		   Oct 7-13    Oct 9-15	 TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>			1996	 1995	    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Stocks/open    390,217.2   246,624.9</p>
<p> Production	36,577.5    33,478.0     546,631.8   358,410.0</p>
<p> Shipment	  26,100.1    20,482.1     311,396.2   247,081.0</p>
<p> Home Market	  336.0	 288.5	 4,324.8     6,046.8</p>
<p> Stocks/close   400,358.6   259,332.3</p>
<p>--Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
